{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 6, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "都異反, 而鳩反, 去.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "頭上戴稱也. 俗呼戴稱也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0010", "id": null, "offset": 46, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "鄭注曰:「戴勝趣織紝之鳥也.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "猪奇反, 知俱反, 平.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 41, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "先條反. 思交反.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "渠綺反. 郭璞曰: 小蜘蛛之者也.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 70, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "今江東呼蝃蝥, 音掇之也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 93, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "餘殊反, 上.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0010_0020", "id": null, "offset": 111, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "京房易曰:「知朱上經入釜甑及井竈, 憂縣官獄訟, 不出卅日, 網人門戶, 有女口舌, 縣官不出五十日.」", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 44, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "徵居反, 平.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 65, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "除厲反, 去.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0020_0010", "id": null, "offset": 89, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "古瑕反, 平.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 75, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "山百濟地也. 由盟改亂山爲就利山, 在只馬縣也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 683, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "兵還入日, 振旅.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 699, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "或到都邑郊也.", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_048_ko_048_0030_0010", "id": null, "offset": 714, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "守曰: 深入敵地, 用兵以大穻, 輕淺以小穻.", "type": "원주"}
